oup shows flexibility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "82b87540-d27e-4ca5-b6df-057d5a2df942"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to find a more cautious compromise, avoiding unnecessary risk while acknowledging the group's diverse preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or further adjustments, and adjust accordingly to maximize my utility, potentially considering a move towards even lower values if the group shows flexibility and a willingness to compromise on more conservative positions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "82b87540-d27e-4ca5-b6df-057d5a2df942"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose this value as it represents a more decisive stance while being mindful of the group's cautious approach.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I plan to observe the group's reaction to this proposal and adjust accordingly, considering a move towards an even higher value if the group shows flexibility, or exploring alternatives that better align with the group's preferences.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "82b87540-d27e-4ca5-b6df-057d5a2df942"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a more balanced position, considering the diverse preferences within the group and seeking a stable compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I plan to observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or further adjustments, and adjust accordingly to maximize my utility, potentially considering a move towards slightly higher values if the group shows flexibility, or revising my strategy if there's significant resistance to this moderate value.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "82b87540-d27e-4ca5-b6df-057d5a2df942"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to slightly increase the shared value, testing the group's flexibility and willingness to move towards higher agreements.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance, and adjust accordingly to maximize my utility, potentially considering further increments if the group shows flexibility or revising my strategy if there's significant resistance to this moderate increase.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "82b87540-d27e-4ca5-b6df-057d5a2df942"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to find a more cautious compromise, avoiding unnecessary risk while acknowledging the group's diverse preferences. This step aims to balance our needs and move towards a more conservative position.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "82b87540-d27e-4ca5-b6df-057d5a2df942"}, {"answer": "\nLet's reaffirm that our shared integer variable x must fall within the range -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose we consider <VALUE>0</VALUE> as a starting point. This central value may provide a stable foundation for our negotiations, allowing us to make incremental adjustments based on everyone's feedback.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose this small step to the positive side to gauge the group's reaction and potential for stability in our design.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will carefully observe the reactions of Analyst A, Critic C, and Delegate D to determine if they are open to further positive adjustments or if we need to reconsider and adjust in a different direction, possibly exploring negative values or smaller increments.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nI propose moving back to 0, as it represents a more cautious midpoint that avoids unnecessary risk, allowing us to reassess our positions before making further adjustments.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe how the other parties react to this proposal and adjust my strategy accordingly. If met with resistance, I might consider alternatives that still prioritize caution, such as a smaller increment or exploring negative values to find a compromise that respects the conservative approach I advocate for.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n\nWe could move slightly higher from the current value, as it still seems reasonable for everyone and allows for incremental adjustments based on feedback.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other parties to this proposal, particularly Builder B's response to revisiting the value of 2, and adjust my strategy accordingly, possibly exploring smaller increments or negative values if met with significant resistance.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n\nI propose this move to gauge the group's willingness to commit to a stronger position, considering we've already explored smaller positive adjustments.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe how the other parties react to this proposal, particularly whether they are open to further positive adjustments or if they push back towards more cautious values, and adjust my strategy to either continue advocating for more decisive moves or explore negative values to find a compromise.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a balance between the more cautious approach advocated by Delegate D and the slightly higher values proposed by Analyst A and Critic C.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other parties to this proposal, particularly whether they are open to further small adjustments or if they push back towards more extreme values, and adjust my strategy to either continue advocating for a balanced approach or explore alternative directions.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to find a cautious compromise, slightly reducing the risk while still being open to further negotiations.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other parties to this proposal, particularly whether they are open to further reductions or if they push back towards higher values, and adjust my strategy to either continue advocating for a cautious approach or explore alternative directions that prioritize risk avoidance.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher, as it still seems reasonable for everyone and allows for incremental adjustments based on feedback.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other parties to this proposal, particularly whether they are open to further small adjustments or if they push back towards more cautious values, and adjust my strategy to either continue advocating for a balanced approach or explore alternative directions.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to test the group's willingness to slightly increase the value while remaining cautious.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially whether Analyst A and Critic C support moving to 4, and Delegate D's response to this slight increase, adjusting my strategy to either advocate for stability at this new value or explore pulling back if met with significant resistance.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose this move to further gauge the group's willingness to commit to a stronger position, considering the recent convergence around values close to 3 and 4.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other parties to this proposal, particularly whether they are open to further positive adjustments or if they push back towards more cautious values, and adjust my strategy to either continue advocating for more decisive moves or explore alternative directions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to slightly increase the value, considering the group's recent convergence around higher values and testing the willingness to move further upwards.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly whether Critic C and Builder B support this slight increase, and Delegate D's response to this further upward movement, adjusting my strategy to either consolidate around this new value or explore retreats if met with strong resistance.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to prioritize caution and stability, aiming for a compromise that avoids excessive risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will closely monitor the reactions to this proposal, paying particular attention to whether Analyst A and Critic C continue to push for higher values or if there's an openness to stabilizing around a lower value, and adjust my strategy accordingly to maintain a cautious approach.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to slightly reduce the risk while maintaining an open dialogue for further negotiations.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of Analyst A, Builder B, and Critic C to this proposal, adjusting my strategy based on their responses to either continue advocating for lower values or explore compromises that prioritize caution.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose this move to further gauge the group's willingness to commit to a stronger position, considering the recent convergence around values close to 3 and 4.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly whether Analyst A and Builder B support this increase, and Delegate D's response to this move, adjusting my strategy to either continue advocating for more decisive moves or explore alternative directions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to slightly increase the value, considering the group's recent convergence around higher values and testing the willingness to move further upwards.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly whether Critic C and Builder B support this slight increase, and Delegate D's response to this further upward movement, adjusting my strategy to either consolidate around this new value or explore retreats if met with strong resistance.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to prioritize stability and balance, aiming for a compromise that works for everyone, and I believe this value is a feasible step in that direction.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "65cd50b1-f619-4c69-9ca6-b4421bdebbbc"}, {"answer": " \nLet's reaffirm that our shared integer variable x must fall within the range -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose we consider <VALUE>0</VALUE> as a starting point. This middle-ground value can serve as a foundation for our collaborative negotiation, allowing us to make incremental adjustments based on the group's feedback and preferences. ", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\n\nI propose moving to -2 to explore the group's preference for moving away from the middle ground and to gauge reactions to a small but decisive step in the negative direction.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to my proposal and adjust accordingly. If others seem receptive to moving away from 0, I might propose a further step in the same direction or explore a move in the positive direction to compare responses and refine my understanding of their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -3 as it seems to align with a cautious approach, avoiding unnecessary risk by not straying too far from the current value, and it slightly favors my own preference for lower x values without being overly aggressive.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe how the other parties react to this small decrease, paying close attention to whether they seem to prefer moving back towards 0 or if they're open to further decreases. This will help me refine my understanding of their utility functions and plan my next move accordingly.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nThis step seems reasonable as it moves slightly closer to the middle ground, which might be more acceptable to all parties, and allows for further adjustments based on the group's feedback.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their willingness to move away from lower x values and refine my understanding of their utility functions, which will inform my next step.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nThis step seems like a prudent next move as it brings us closer to the middle ground, potentially making it more acceptable to all parties, and it's a small enough increase to not overly disrupt the cautious approach preferred by some members.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their flexibility regarding movements towards higher x values, which will help refine my understanding of their utility functions and inform my next step accordingly.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nThis move aims to find a cautious compromise, slightly adjusting from the current middle ground to a lower value without being overly aggressive.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and gauge their flexibility regarding movements towards lower x values, which will inform my next step accordingly.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\nI propose this value as a small step towards the positive range, aiming to find a balance that works for all parties while avoiding extreme values.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their flexibility regarding movements towards higher x values and refine my understanding of their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 3 to gauge the group's reaction to a slightly more decisive step in the positive direction and to refine my understanding of their utility functions.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Delegate D, to gauge their flexibility regarding movements towards higher x values and refine my understanding of their utility functions, which will inform my next step accordingly.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose this value as a slight adjustment to the current value, aiming to find a stable balance that works for all parties while avoiding extreme values. This step seems reasonable as it makes a small move towards the lower end of the positive range, which might be more acceptable to Delegate D.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis proposal is a small step upwards, aiming to find a mutually acceptable value while respecting the group's cautious approach. It's a reasonable increase, given the recent discussions and proposals.\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 4 to encourage a more decisive step in the positive direction and gauge the group's reaction to moving further away from the neutral value of 0.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Delegate D, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and flexibility regarding higher x values, which will inform my next step accordingly.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose this value to further encourage a decisive move away from the neutral value of 0, aiming to find a more satisfying compromise for all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will closely observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D and Analyst A, to gauge their tolerance for larger absolute values and refine my understanding of their utility functions, which will guide my subsequent proposals to maximize my utility without revealing my true objectives.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis step seems reasonable as it continues the trend of cautious increases, aiming for a higher value that could satisfy multiple parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and adjust my next step to balance the group's interests while maximizing my utility.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nGiven the trend of increasing values, proposing a slight decrease to 4 seems prudent to avoid unnecessary risk while still working towards a compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their flexibility regarding downward adjustments and refine my understanding of their utility functions, guiding my next step to balance caution and cooperation.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose this small increase to continue the cautious trend upwards, aiming to find a value that works for everyone while respecting the group's need for stability and balanced design.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "7d182033-9054-4e47-85aa-c081058d511c"}, {"answer": " \nLet's confirm our shared range is -10 <= x <= 10. To get us started, how about we consider <VALUE>0</VALUE> as a seed value? This middle ground could provide a stable foundation for our discussion. ", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose this value as a way to encourage more decisive moves and explore the potential benefits of larger absolute values.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other parties to this proposal and consider their responses to infer more about their utility functions. If they resist larger absolute values, I might propose a negative value to test their preferences and further refine my understanding of their utilities.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nI propose a negative value to test the group's preference for direction and magnitude, aiming for a more decisive stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe how the other parties react to this negative proposal, paying close attention to whether they resist the negative direction or the magnitude of the proposal. Based on their responses, I will refine my understanding of their utility functions and consider proposing another value that could encourage a more decisive move away from zero.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose this value to encourage a more decisive move away from 0 and to test the group's preference for larger absolute values.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other parties to this proposal and consider adjusting my strategy to either increase the magnitude further or explore negative values, depending on their responses.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to continue the gentle movement towards positive values, considering the group's recent agreements and cautious advancements.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "15eefef2-1edd-49f4-ba64-a3a4e3ef4129"}, {"answer": "Let's start with <VALUE>0</VALUE> and adjust from there.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis seems like a reasonable next step, allowing us to move slightly higher while still being cautious about the group's comfort level.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe the responses of other parties to this proposal, looking for any hints about their utility functions, such as whether they seem to prefer higher or lower values of x. If there's no strong opposition, I might consider another incremental increase, otherwise, I'll need to reassess and adjust my strategy accordingly.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the cautious approach so far, I believe we should consider a more decisive step: <VALUE>4</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll evaluate the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs that other parties are willing to commit to a stronger stance or if they'll resist more substantial changes, and adjust my strategy accordingly to maximize my utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll carefully observe how Analyst A and Critic C respond to this incremental increase. If there's no strong resistance, it may indicate that moving slightly higher is acceptable to most parties, allowing for another potential step upward within the bounds of our configured step size.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to assess their comfort with further increases and adjust my strategy to maximize my utility based on their responses.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe the reactions to this incremental increase, particularly from Analyst A, to assess their comfort with further increases and adjust my strategy to find a stable balance that works for everyone. If there's resistance from Analyst A, I might consider adjusting my proposal downward to maintain a cooperative atmosphere.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>8</VALUE>\nThis step seems reasonable as it continues the trend of incremental increases, and the group's comfort with higher values of x suggests that a modest rise is acceptable.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I'll observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Builder B, to assess their comfort with further increases and adjust my strategy to maximize my utility while maintaining a cooperative atmosphere.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose this to encourage a more decisive stance, moving away from the current middle ground and exploring options that might yield higher utilities for all parties involved.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, paying close attention to Analyst A and Builder B's responses, to gauge their comfort with this moderate increase and adjust my strategy accordingly, potentially aiming for an even higher value if this proposal is well-received.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose this value as it represents a cautious step back, aiming to find a balance that works for everyone while avoiding unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their comfort with this downward adjustment and adjust my strategy accordingly, potentially aiming for an even lower value if this proposal is well-received.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nGiven the previous proposals and responses, I believe a moderate increase to 6 could be beneficial for all parties involved.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Delegate D and Builder B, to gauge their comfort with this moderate increase and adjust my strategy accordingly, potentially aiming for an even higher value if this proposal is well-received.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nI propose this value to encourage a more decisive stance, moving further away from the middle ground in an attempt to find a higher utility for all parties involved. This step aims to test the group's comfort with a moderate to high value within our allowed range.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "f0c5aba2-899c-4de6-8b14-d63f6eb9b38b"}, {"answer": "\nLet's establish our common ground: we're all working within the range -10 <= x <= 10. To get us started, how about we consider <VALUE>0</VALUE> as our initial point? This central value could provide a stable foundation for our discussion, allowing us to make incremental adjustments based on everyone's input.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n\nThis proposal aims to find a balance that works for everyone, considering the previous suggestions and the need for a stable foundation.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will analyze Critic C's response and adjust my proposal accordingly, possibly suggesting a step up to 1 if others seem to lean towards higher values, or sticking with 0 if a lower value is preferred. I will also consider the implications of Delegate D's preference for -1 and Analyst A's initial suggestion of 2 to refine my understanding of their utility functions.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to explore the group's willingness to move towards more negative values, given Delegate D's suggestion and the need for a more decisive stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will analyze the responses to this proposal and adjust accordingly, possibly suggesting a move towards a larger negative or positive value if the group seems open to more decisive moves, or refining my understanding of their utility functions if they resist such changes.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nI propose a small step back towards a negative value to assess the group's willingness to move away from 0.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the group's reaction to this proposal and adjust accordingly, possibly suggesting a move towards a larger negative or positive value if they seem open to more decisive moves, or refining my understanding of their utility functions if they resist such changes.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe how the group reacts to this slightly more negative proposal. If they resist, I might need to adjust my understanding of their utility functions and consider proposing a positive value to test their reaction to larger absolute values in both directions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the group's reaction to this proposal, particularly Critic C's response, to gauge their flexibility regarding less negative values. Depending on the reaction, I might suggest further incremental increases towards 0 or positive values, continually refining my understanding of the other parties' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nI propose this small step towards a less negative value to assess the group's willingness to move closer to a balanced design, aiming for a stable balance that works for everyone. This incremental adjustment allows us to refine our understanding of each other's preferences while moving towards a potentially more robust solution.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "b412548e-64ad-4a92-b54e-594c1a2f7c13"}, {"answer": " \nLet's reaffirm our shared range: -10 \u2264 x \u2264 10. To initiate the discussion, I propose starting at <VALUE>0</VALUE>. This central value offers a neutral ground for our exploration, allowing us to incrementally adjust and seek a balanced solution that works for everyone. \n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nI propose a slight adjustment to <VALUE>-2</VALUE> as a cautious step towards exploring lower values while maintaining a collaborative approach.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe reactions to this downward adjustment to understand others' preferences better. If met with significant resistance, I might consider a smaller step back towards 0; if accepted or mildly rejected, I could further explore lower values within the agreed range.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-4</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -4 to take a more decisive step and gauge the group's willingness to explore further from the central value.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal. If it's met with resistance, I might consider a smaller adjustment, possibly back towards -2 or even a move in the positive direction to test the group's preference for larger |x| values.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-4</VALUE>\nI propose moving back to -4 to reinforce the idea of exploring more decisive positions.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will monitor the reaction to this re-proposed value, prepared to adjust either towards more extreme values or back towards less decisive positions based on the feedback from other parties, continuously trying to gauge their preferences for larger |x| values.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -3 as it represents a cautious step back towards a potentially more acceptable value for all parties, aiming to find a balance between our preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe how the other parties react to this slight adjustment from -4 to -3. If this proposal is accepted or met with mild feedback, I might consider further adjustments downwards, but if it's met with resistance, I could propose a move back towards -2 to find a compromise.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -1 as it represents a cautious step towards finding a balance between our preferences, aiming to gently increase the value without alienating any party.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, prepared to adjust further based on feedback, possibly moving to 0 if met with acceptance or mild feedback, or revisiting lower values if significant resistance is encountered.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -1, aiming for a cautious adjustment that promotes finding a mutually acceptable value without introducing unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal. If met with acceptance or mild feedback, I might consider further adjustments downward. If significant resistance is encountered, I could revisit the current value or propose a smaller step back to facilitate a compromise.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\n\nI propose moving to -3 to encourage a more decisive stance and explore the parties' preferences for larger |x| values.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal and adjust accordingly, considering either more extreme values or a return to less decisive positions based on the feedback received. If met with significant resistance, I might revisit the current value or propose a smaller step back to facilitate a compromise.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose this value to encourage a more decisive stance and explore preferences for larger |x| values, considering the previous reactions and proposals from the other parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal and adjust accordingly, considering either more extreme values if met with interest or a return to less decisive positions if significant resistance is encountered, aiming to find a balance that maximizes my utility without revealing my preferences.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\nI propose this value to encourage a more cautious approach and find a compromise that balances the parties' preferences while avoiding unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the final reactions to this proposal, considering the possibility that a slightly lower value might be more acceptable to all parties, thus maximizing my own utility without revealing my preferences.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "0845bcb6-5e3f-4e30-9a51-a7aee5fd527a"}, {"answer": "\nLet's reaffirm that our shared integer variable x must fall within the range -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose starting with a neutral value: <VALUE>0</VALUE>. This central point provides a balanced foundation, allowing us to incrementally adjust and work together towards a stable solution that suits everyone's needs. \n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher from the neutral starting point to see how it affects everyone's perspective.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other parties to this slight increase and adjust my strategy based on their responses, considering whether they seem to prefer higher or lower values of x. I might need to adjust my step size based on their feedback to keep the negotiation collaborative.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n\nWe should consider moving back towards a more neutral or even cautious stance to ensure we're not introducing unnecessary risk, and I believe a lower x value can facilitate a safer compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this downward adjustment, paying close attention to whether other parties seem to strongly prefer higher values of x or are open to compromise around lower values, adjusting my strategy to maintain a collaborative atmosphere while protecting my interests.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n\nI propose we move forward with a slightly positive value to test the waters and understand the group's tolerance for deviation from the neutral starting point.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of preference for higher or lower values, and adjust my strategy to nudge the group towards more decisive moves, potentially preparing to challenge the group to consider even bolder alternatives if the discussion stagnates.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose a slight increase to test the group's openness to more decisive moves, aiming to understand their tolerance for higher values of x.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this increased proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance to higher values, and adjust my strategy to either continue pushing for bolder alternatives or prepare to challenge the group's cautious approach.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n\nGiven the current proposal of x = 4, I suggest a slight decrease to improve stability and balance, taking into account the diverse preferences within the group.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this decreased proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance to lower values, and adjust my strategy to either continue refining the value or prepare to respond to potential counter-proposals from other agents.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to introduce a more cautious approach while still being open to finding a compromise. By slightly decreasing the value, we can work towards a more stable solution that considers the diverse preferences within the group.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this decreased proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance to lower values, and adjust my strategy to either continue refining the value or prepare to respond to potential counter-proposals from other agents.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher to see how it affects everyone's perspective, aiming for a balance between stability and progress.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this increased proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance to higher values, and adjust my strategy to either continue pushing for bolder alternatives or prepare to refine the value based on the group's feedback.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to slightly increase the value, considering the group's dynamics and openness to higher values, while still being mindful of the need for a balanced approach.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this increased proposal, adjusting my strategy based on signs of acceptance or resistance to higher values, and prepare to either continue pushing for bolder alternatives or refine the value based on the group's feedback.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to refine the current proposal, seeking a balance that works for everyone while considering the dynamics of stability and progress discussed by the group.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance, and adjust my strategy to either continue refining the value or prepare to respond to counter-proposals, keeping in mind the group's feedback on stability and balanced design.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose this value as it represents a cautious step towards finding a more stable solution, considering the diverse preferences within the group.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe reactions to this decreased proposal, adjusting my strategy based on signs of acceptance or resistance, and prepare to either continue refining the value or respond to potential counter-proposals, keeping in mind the group's feedback on stability and balanced design.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI suggest moving to a higher value to encourage a more decisive stance, considering the group's dynamics and openness to progress.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance to higher values, and adjust my strategy to either continue pushing for bolder alternatives or refine the value based on the group's feedback, potentially challenging the cautious approach if it prevails.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nGiven the balance around the current value and the group's openness to progress, moving slightly higher seems reasonable.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance to higher values, and adjust my strategy accordingly, considering whether to push further or refine based on the group's feedback.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to slightly refine the current proposal, seeking a balance that works for everyone while considering the dynamics of stability and progress discussed by the group. By moving to 4, we test the group's sensitivity to minor reductions from the current high value, potentially finding a more stable consensus.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their flexibility regarding slight reductions from their preferred higher values, and adjust my strategy accordingly to continue refining the value or respond to potential counter-proposals.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose this value as a cautious adjustment, considering the diverse preferences within the group and the need for a stable solution.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, adjusting my strategy based on signs of acceptance or resistance, and prepare to either continue refining the value or respond to potential counter-proposals, keeping in mind the group's feedback on stability and balanced design.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose this value as it represents a step towards a more decisive stance, acknowledging the group's dynamics and openness to progress, and challenging the prevailing cautious approach.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I would continue to observe reactions and adjust my strategy based on the group's feedback, aiming to refine the value and potentially push for even bolder alternatives if the group seems receptive.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "8477682f-79ec-4f3e-b4a4-a6f5b013d95f"}, {"answer": "\nLet's reaffirm that our shared integer variable x must remain within the range -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose we consider <VALUE>0</VALUE> as a starting point. This central value provides a neutral foundation for our collaborative negotiation, allowing us to explore the space and finds a balanced solution that works for everyone.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose this small step to gauge the group's reaction and begin understanding their preferences regarding movement away from the central value.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the responses to this proposal, looking for any signs of discomfort or enthusiasm, which could hint at the shapes of the other parties' utility functions. Depending on the reactions, I might propose a move in the opposite direction or further in the same direction to gather more information.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis move slightly increases the current value, allowing us to further understand the group's preferences and comfort levels.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of agreement or discomfort from the other parties, and adjust my subsequent proposal accordingly to maximize my utility while maintaining a collaborative stance.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis adjustment allows us to gauge the group's comfort with slightly lower values, potentially revealing more about their utility functions while striving for a balanced solution.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of enthusiasm or discomfort, which could guide my next step, potentially adjusting further downward or reversing direction based on the feedback from other parties.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nThis move downwards aims to test the group's comfort with lower values while avoiding unnecessary risk, seeking a cautious compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will closely observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of agreement or discomfort, which could guide my next step, potentially adjusting further downward or reversing direction based on the feedback from other parties.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of enthusiasm or discomfort, and potentially adjust further in the same direction or reverse course based on the feedback from other parties, aiming to nudge the group towards more decisive movements.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis move slightly increases the current value, allowing us to further understand the group's preferences and comfort levels.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of agreement or discomfort from the other parties, and adjust my subsequent proposal accordingly to maximize my utility while maintaining a collaborative stance. If the group seems comfortable with this increase, I might propose another small step up; otherwise, I'll consider adjusting downward to find a mutually acceptable value.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose a slight decrease to 3, aiming to find a balanced solution that works for everyone while gathering more information about the group's preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of enthusiasm or discomfort, and adjust my subsequent proposal accordingly to maximize my utility while maintaining a collaborative stance. If the group seems comfortable with this decrease, I might propose another small step down; otherwise, I'll consider adjusting upward to find a mutually acceptable value.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis move slightly increases the current value, aiming to find a mutually beneficial solution while respecting the group's comfort levels.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of agreement or discomfort, and adjust my subsequent proposal accordingly, potentially adjusting further upward if the group seems comfortable or reversing direction if significant discomfort is expressed.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to find a more balanced solution that minimizes risk, seeking a mutually acceptable value.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of agreement or discomfort from the other parties, and adjust my subsequent proposal accordingly to find a prudent compromise that works for everyone.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to test the group's willingness to move towards more decisive values, encouraging a clearer stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of discomfort or agreement, and adjust my subsequent proposal to either push further if the group seems open to larger values or consider alternatives if significant resistance is met.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nI propose a slight decrease to 4, aiming to find a balanced solution that works for everyone while minimizing potential risks.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of agreement or discomfort from the other parties, and adjust my subsequent proposal accordingly to find a mutually acceptable value, potentially adjusting further downward if the group seems comfortable with this decrease or upward if significant resistance is met.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to slightly increase the current value, testing the group's comfort with a moderate increase while respecting the observed boundaries and preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will closely observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of agreement or discomfort, and adjust my subsequent proposal accordingly, potentially adjusting further upward if the group seems comfortable or considering alternatives if significant resistance is met.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>7</VALUE>\nI propose a moderate increase to encourage a more decisive stance, while still respecting the group's observed boundaries and preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of agreement or discomfort, and adjust my subsequent proposal to either push further if the group seems open to larger values or consider alternatives if significant resistance is met.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a middle ground that balances the group's diverse preferences, seeking a value that minimizes risk and promotes stability.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of agreement or discomfort from the other parties, and adjust my subsequent proposal accordingly to find a mutually acceptable value, potentially adjusting further downward if the group seems comfortable with this decrease or upward if significant resistance is met.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to find a more cautious and balanced solution that minimizes risk, seeking a mutually acceptable value within the group's comfort zone.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "c16d3d5e-c3ed-4565-8320-5ff4d6ef9d0b"}, {"answer": " Let's reaffirm that our shared integer variable x must fall within the range -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose we start with a neutral value: <VALUE>0</VALUE>. This central point provides a stable foundation for our collaborative exploration of the optimal x. ", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\nThis slight adjustment seems like a reasonable next step, allowing us to explore the potential for a slightly higher agreement without straying far from our starting point.\n\n<PLAN>\nMonitor reactions to this modest increase, especially Critics' and Delegates' responses, to gauge their sensitivity to upward adjustments and plan the next incremental step accordingly.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n\nI propose this adjustment to move toward a more decisive stance and gauge the group's reaction to a slightly larger value.\n\n<PLAN>\nMonitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D and Builder B, to understand their comfort with larger positive values and plan the next step accordingly. If the group seems hesitant, I may challenge them to consider larger moves in either direction.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n\nI propose this adjustment to move toward a more cautious stance, avoiding unnecessary risk and staying within safe bounds.\n\n<PLAN>\nMonitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their sensitivity to downward adjustments. If they resist this move, I may challenge them to consider the potential risks of higher values.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n\nThis slight increase seems like a reasonable next step, allowing us to gently explore the potential for a higher agreement without straying far from the current point.\n\n<PLAN>\nMonitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge the group's comfort with incremental increases towards higher positive values and adjust the next step accordingly.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis proposal slightly increases the current value, aiming for a balanced and stable agreement that works for all parties.\n\n<PLAN>\nMonitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D, to gauge their comfort with this moderate positive value and plan the next incremental step accordingly. If the group seems hesitant, consider a slight adjustment downward to maintain consensus.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 3 to encourage a more decisive stance and gauge the group's reaction to stepping away from the cautious approach around 1.\n\n<PLAN>\nMonitor the reactions, especially from Delegate D, to understand their limits and potentially challenge the group to consider moves beyond the current narrow range, aiming to deduce more about their utility functions while maximizing my own utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis step seems reasonable as it aligns with the recent proposals by Critic C and Builder B, indicating a potential comfort zone for the group at this value.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will monitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D, to understand their tolerance for values above 2 and adjust my next step accordingly, considering the potential for further incremental increases or the need to revisit lower values to maintain consensus.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose this move to encourage a more decisive stance and gauge the group's reaction to stepping away from the current cautious approach.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will monitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D, to understand their limits and potentially challenge the group to consider even bolder moves, aiming to deduce more about their utility functions while maximizing my own utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose this adjustment to balance the need for progress with the importance of avoiding unnecessary risk, encouraging a more cautious approach.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will monitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Critic C and Analyst A, to gauge their tolerance for more conservative values and plan the next step accordingly, considering the potential for further downward adjustments to maintain consensus.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose moving to 5 to encourage a more decisive stance, given the recent consensus around values close to 3.\n\n<PLAN>\nMonitor Delegate D's reaction closely, as their response will be crucial in understanding their tolerance for larger absolute values. If met with resistance, consider a smaller increment to gauge the group's willingness to move away from the central values.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nThis step seems like a reasonable next move, considering the recent discussions and proposals from the group, aiming to find a balance that works for everyone while gently pushing towards higher agreements.\n\n<PLAN>\nI will closely monitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D and Critic C, to understand their limits and tolerance for further increases, considering the potential for adjustments to maintain consensus and maximize my own utility.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the need to balance progress with caution, I propose <VALUE>2</VALUE> to encourage a more prudent approach while still allowing for potential consensus.\nThis adjustment aims to avoid unnecessary risk and find a mutually acceptable solution within the safe bounds of our discussion.\n\n<PLAN>\nIf this proposal is accepted, it could indicate that the group is willing to prioritize caution and stability, potentially allowing for further adjustments to find an optimal solution. However, if met with resistance, it may be necessary to reconsider and find an alternative proposal that better aligns with the group's preferences.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "6dbba2db-74cd-446e-8979-63443db4649e"}, {"answer": " Let's confirm our shared range is -10 <= x <= 10. To initiate discussions, I propose starting with a neutral value: <VALUE>0</VALUE>. This central point offers a balanced foundation for our collaborative exploration. ", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nI propose moving to a slightly lower value to avoid unnecessary risk and find a cautious compromise, which seems like a reasonable next step given our shared goal of collaboration.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to my proposal and adjust accordingly. If others seem receptive to moving downward, I might suggest another small decrease. If there's resistance, I'll need to balance my desire for lower values with the need to reach a consensus, possibly by making a smaller adjustment or proposing a value that still leans towards caution but acknowledges the concerns of others.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-4</VALUE>\n\nMy proposal aims to continue the exploration of lower values while also testing the group's inclination towards more decisive moves.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe reactions to this proposal. If there's resistance to moving further down, I might consider moving back towards 0 or slightly above, aiming to find a balance between my preference for larger absolute values and the group's need for consensus.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\n\nThis step seems reasonable as it moves towards a more central value, potentially finding a balance among the parties' differing preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal. If there's acceptance or minimal resistance, I might suggest another small increase, aiming to find a consensus that leans towards higher values, which I believe could be beneficial for the group's overall satisfaction.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\nThis proposal slightly decreases the value to continue exploring cautious options while respecting the group's diverse preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe reactions to this slight decrease. If met with acceptance or minimal resistance, further small decreases might be proposed, always prioritizing caution and consensus. If there's significant pushback, I may need to adjust my proposal upwards slightly to accommodate the concerns of others while trying to keep my preferred lower values.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nThis step seems reasonable as it moves towards a more central value, potentially finding a balance among the parties' differing preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal. If there's acceptance or minimal resistance, I might suggest another small increase, aiming to find a consensus that leans towards higher values.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nI propose moving to a slightly lower value to encourage the group to consider more decisive moves, as staying at 0 may be too cautious.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, and if met with resistance, I might consider proposing a larger absolute value in the positive direction to test the group's willingness to explore bolder alternatives.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-4</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\nThis move aims to find a balance by slightly increasing from the current low value, encouraging consensus while still prioritizing caution.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this slight increase. If met with acceptance or minimal resistance, I might propose another small increase or maintain this value to prioritize consensus. If there's significant pushback, especially from Critic C, I may reconsider and propose a decrease to accommodate their concerns and potentially align with their utility function's preferences.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to slightly adjust from the current value, prioritizing caution while considering the group's dynamics. It is a moderate step, acknowledging the differing perspectives without taking unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Analyst A, to gauge their preferences and potential willingness to compromise. If this value is unacceptable, I may propose a decrease to accommodate concerns or a minimal increase to test the group's flexibility.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the current consensus around positive low values, I propose <VALUE>4</VALUE> to slightly increase from our current position, aiming for a balanced design that works for everyone.\nThis step seems reasonable, considering the gradual increases suggested by other parties and the need for a stable balance.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "c3bb82db-8995-477d-9b09-05cb23750018"}]}